WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.880
If I had zero sales, zero audience, and

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:07.680
I wanted to make my first dollar online

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:10.040
in 2026, this is the exact digital

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:11.920
product that I would make. And spoiler,

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:14.240
it's not a course, and it is definitely

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:15.360
not something complicated. So, in

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:17.520
today's video, I'm going to walk you

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:19.960
through exactly what I would create, why

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:21.080
it works, and how you can build it in a

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:22.520
day.

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:24.720
So, the first thing that you're going to

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:26.640
need to do is need to think about not

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:28.160
something that you want to create, but

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.760
something that actually solves a

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:31.280
problem. Instead of just picking

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:32.960
something random that sounds like fun to

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:35.720
