00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:37.920
doing is think of a problem that you

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:40.160
have already solved either for yourself

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:42.480
or for another person. This could look

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:44.080
like creating a simple meal calendar for

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:46.240
you and your family, creating a simple

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:47.840
workout plan for yourself, or something

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:49.720
that I personally have done is I have

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:51.480
solved the problem of figuring out how

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:53.200
to get monetized on this platform right

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:55.200
here, YouTube. It doesn't need to be

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:56.800
something super life-changing. It can be

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:58.520
a very simple problem that you have

00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:00.680
solved. Another way that you can think

00:00:58.520 --> 00:01:03.120
about this is if somebody has ever asked

00:01:00.680 --> 00:01:05.000
you how you do something, maybe it is

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:07.600
how you keep your family on a tight

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:10.320
