00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:13.360
resume template, a content planner, or a

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:14.840
how I did X guide. And this is why I

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:16.600
actually created my Mom to Monetize

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:18.400
ebook. I already had people in my

00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:20.480
