00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:22.360
for tips for growth, how to actually get

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:24.120
monetized, how to get brand deals. So, I

00:01:22.360 --> 00:01:26.080
actually went ahead and created an ebook

00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:27.520
that answered all these questions since

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:29.640
I knew there was a demand for it. People

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:31.400
were already asking me about it. But, I

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:33.360
know a lot of people actually get very

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:35.400
overwhelmed with the concept of actually

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:37.400
creating a digital product, and they

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:39.600
tend to overcomplicate it. I know I

00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:41.600
really did when I first got started. So,

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:44.040
here's what I recommend doing instead.

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:46.400
So, step two is starting with a tiny

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:48.560
offer. What you should not do here is

00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:50.560
create a very complicated course, a

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:52.360
