00:01:56.080 --> 00:02:00.040
get going and start building up your

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:02.360
audience, in order to get started, it is

00:02:00.040 --> 00:02:04.160
totally not necessary. What I would

00:02:02.360 --> 00:02:06.960
start with is something much simpler,

00:02:04.160 --> 00:02:09.360
things like a checklist, a short guide,

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:10.800
a swipe file, or a Canva or Notion

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:12.360
template. What I recommend thinking

00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:14.520
about here is something that is going to

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:17.200
save somebody time immediately. Another

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:19.720
few examples and ideas for you could be

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:22.360
50 digital product ideas, content

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:24.600
